{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.decideRedirect\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">Protocol</span>.<span class=\"name\">H1</span>.<span class=\"name\">decideRedirect</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">current</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Origin\">URI.Origin</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">request</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Request.html#Std.Http.Request.Head\">Request.Head</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">bodyReplayable</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">status</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Status.html#Std.Http.Status\">Status</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">responseHeaders</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Headers.html#Std.Http.Headers\">Headers</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectOutcome\">RedirectOutcome</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Decides whether to follow a redirect given the server's response-line status and headers, the\npending request, and whether the request body is replayable.\n\nReturns `.done` when:\n* the status is not a 3xx redirection,\n* the request is a `CONNECT`, whose target is the authority to tunnel to (RFC 9110 §9.3.6), not a\n  resource a `Location` can stand in for,\n* no `Location` header is present,\n* the `Location` value does not parse as a URI-reference (RFC 9110 §10.2.2),\n* the target names no host, or resolves to a non-`http(s)` scheme (SSRF guard),\n* the redirect keeps a method other than `GET`/`HEAD` but the body cannot be replayed.\n\nReturns `.follow plan` otherwise. The caller is expected to drain the redirect response body and,\nwhen `plan.bodyAction == .replay`, reset the original body before dispatching the rewritten request.\nOn a cross-origin hop the original `Host` header is rewritten to the new origin, but only when one\nwas present; if the original request carried no `Host`, supplying one for the new origin is the\ncaller's responsibility.\n\nNotes on specific status codes that always return `.done`:\n* 300 Multiple Choices — may carry a `Location` naming the server's preferred choice, but\n  RFC 9110 §15.4.1 leaves the selection to the user agent, so we deliberately do not auto-select.\n* 304 Not Modified — cache revalidation result, not a navigation redirect.\n* 305 Use Proxy — deprecated (RFC 9110 §15.4.6); blocked for security.\n* 306 — reserved/unused.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.decideRedirect","kind":"def","line":339,"name":"Std.Http.Protocol.H1.decideRedirect","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.lean#L339-L440"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.instInhabitedRedirectOutcome\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">Protocol</span>.<span class=\"name\">H1</span>.<span class=\"name\">instInhabitedRedirectOutcome</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Inhabited\">Inhabited</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectOutcome\">RedirectOutcome</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.instInhabitedRedirectOutcome","kind":"instance","line":107,"name":"Std.Http.Protocol.H1.instInhabitedRedirectOutcome","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.lean#L107-L107"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectOutcome.follow\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">Protocol</span>.<span class=\"name\">H1</span>.<span class=\"name\">RedirectOutcome</span>.<span class=\"name\">follow</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">plan</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectPlan\">RedirectPlan</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectOutcome\">RedirectOutcome</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Follow the redirect described by `plan`.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectOutcome.follow","kind":"ctor","line":103,"name":"Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectOutcome.follow","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.lean#L103-L106"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectOutcome.done\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">Protocol</span>.<span class=\"name\">H1</span>.<span class=\"name\">RedirectOutcome</span>.<span class=\"name\">done</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectOutcome\">RedirectOutcome</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Response is final. Stop redirecting and return it.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectOutcome.done","kind":"ctor","line":98,"name":"Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectOutcome.done","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.lean#L98-L101"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">inductive</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectOutcome\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">Protocol</span>.<span class=\"name\">H1</span>.<span class=\"name\">RedirectOutcome</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Result of evaluating whether to follow a redirect.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectOutcome","kind":"inductive","line":93,"name":"Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectOutcome","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.lean#L93-L107"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.instReprRedirectPlan.repr\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">Protocol</span>.<span class=\"name\">H1</span>.<span class=\"name\">instReprRedirectPlan</span>.<span class=\"name\">repr</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Http/Protocol/H1/Redirect.html#Std.Http.Protocol.H1.RedirectPlan\">Red